== 2013 card==
From the back of the 2013 card:

'''Born:''' 1955<br />
'''Birthplace:''' Detroit, Michigan, USA<br />
'''Designer:''' General Motors<br />
'''Specialty: ''' This old-school gasser boasts a blown big-block race engine with open fender headers, removed hood and a stripped interior. With leaf springs up front and ladder bars in back, it's always ready to tear up the track!

